3	/// spec-6-4 — a single user-only chat bubble's own bookmark affordance
4	/// (AGENTS.md: "a four-state... idle/saving/saved/error bookmark button to
5	/// user-only chat bubbles"), mirrors `entries/domain/entities/
6	/// sync_badge_state.dart`'s own per-feature placement/shape: sealed, with
7	/// `const factory` constructors on the base class so call sites read as
8	/// `BookmarkState.idle()` rather than naming each subclass directly.
9	/// Never persisted across restarts (Never) — in-memory only, on
10	/// `ChatUiMessage.bookmarkState`.
11	sealed class BookmarkState {
12	  const BookmarkState();
13	
14	  const factory BookmarkState.idle() = BookmarkIdle;
