67	/// The save failed — red warning, retryable: tapping it re-attempts the
68	/// same save (I/O matrix: "Save fails"). [failure] is kept for parity with
69	/// `SyncBadgeError`'s own shape, even though `ChatBubble` only ever needs
70	/// the state's own identity (icon/color), never [failure]'s own message —
